{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9a811096-617d-81a8-83ab-88e401bb22e0",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T17:50:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Andres Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey Kevin, yeah, I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed and all, but the recording said this line's up for storm stuff. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the road in front of my rental is a sheet of ice. Wicked slick. Totally glare ice. That rain Monday on top of Sunday's snow just froze up solid tonight. Nobody's put down sand or salt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, that snow-to-rain mess from the weekend. Which street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly I'd rather not get into the street, I just want to know when somebody's gonna come through and treat it. Like, is there a time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Without a street I can't tell you where you are in the route. I can log it as an icy road complaint, needs sand or salt, and call out to the crew lead. Crews are hitting the main roads first and then the side streets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's a no on a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you an honest time, no. Tonight, tomorrow morning, it depends how the refreeze hits everywhere. Want to give me the street so I can note it down? Icy, needs sand, called Tuesday evening..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on a sec. [pause] No, buddy, daddy's on the phone. She wants to know what you look like. Seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tell her I'm a guy in a fleece vest with a headset and a cold cup of coffee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, she says that's boring. Fine. It's the stretch off Thames, the side street by the corner store. I'll give you the number too, 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0178, icy side street off Thames, sand or salt requested. I'll pass it along tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Appreciate it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Stay off that ice, take care."
    }
  ],
